ros-jazzy-realsense2-tutorial-demo (2.3-5) noble; urgency=medium

  * Add camera_type launch argument (usb/gmsl) with a find_cameras.sh helper
    script to detect which is connected, replacing the old use_sub_camera arg.
  * Explicitly set rgb_camera.color_profile and depth_module.depth_profile for
    the D457 GMSL branch to avoid the driver's invalid-resolution fallback.
  * Add image_transport_overrides.yaml, restricting each raw image topic to
    its compatible transports (color vs depth). Fixes realsense2_camera_node
    attaching the color compressor to depth topics and vice versa, which threw
    continuous conversion errors and caused visible camera stream stutter.

 -- ECI Maintainer <eci.maintainer@intel.com>  Wed, 19 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000

